            "review_title": "Review at French Grill",
            "review_text": "Faye P\n1 contribution\n0\nCelebrating a birthday dinner\nDec 2025 • Family\nAmazing food and service, each dish was crafted so well and exotically. The wine pairing also amazingly. The highlight was definitely when we requested a birthday special and they brought out custom drinks from the bartender, a box of hand crafted chocolates, and the sweetest hand written note! Definitely amazing service and love from the chefs and waiters. Amazing atmosphere though out the night too with the ambient lighting and great view of Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 20, 2025",
